        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kritho ɛ luääkdan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyin tiɛtnikä, ɣän gɔ̱a̱rä yɛ ti̱ti̱ kɛ ɣöö /ci yɛn bi duer. Kä mi tëëkɛ ram mi ci duer, te kɔn kɛ ɣo̱o̱r kɛɛl kɛ Gua̱a̱ra ɛ jɛn Yecu Kritho in la gua̱n cuŋni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛ jɛn muc in ca luɛl ni dueerkɔn, kä /ciɛ kui̱ dueerikɔn kärɔ̱, kä amäni dueer ɣɔaa diaal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ kɛ nɛmɛ banɛ jɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö ŋäc kɔn Yecu, mi luɔ̱thnɛ luëëkɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ram mi laar jɛ i̱, “Ɣän ŋa̱cä jɛ,” kä yärɛ luëëkɛ ɛ gua̱n kacä, kä ram mi ce̱tkɛ ɛnɔ /ci thuɔ̱k te rɛydɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ram mi luth rietdɛ jɛn ram ɛmɔ ci nhök Kuɔth cop rɛydɛ kɛ thuɔ̱k. Banɛ jɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö te kɔn rɛydɛ kɛ nɛmɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ram mi laar jɛ i̱, “Ta̱a̱ rɛy Yecu,” gɔaa ni ɣöö bɛ cieŋ kɛ ciaŋ ëë cieŋ kɛ Yecu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mat ruac mi pay tuɔɔk",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nhöökä, /ciɛ luek mi pay tuɔɔk ɛ nɛ gɔ̱a̱rä yɛ mɛ, kä duundɛ ɣöö ɛ luek ëë wal, mëë tekɛ yɛ ni tukä ɣɔaa. Luek ëë wal ɛmɛ ɛ jɛn riet ëë cia kɔŋ liŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ, gɔ̱a̱rä yɛ luek mi pay tuɔɔk bä, min la thuɔ̱k rɛy Yecu kɛnɛ rɛydun, kɛ ɣöö muth wee kɛ wä, kä ci buay in thuɔ̱k ku thuŋ lɛ̈p. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ram mi laar jɛ i̱, “Ta̱a̱ rɛy buɔyä,” kä nyiirɛ gaatman, ŋotdɛ rɛy muɔ̱th. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ram mi nhɔk gaatman, cieŋɛ rɛy buɔyä, kä rɛydɛ thilɛ mi dee radɔ̱diɛn jakä bɛ duer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ram mi nyiir däman tëë rɛy muɔ̱th, kä jälɛ rɛy muɔ̱th, kä kui̱cɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p mi wä kɛ jɛ, kɛ ɣöö ci muth nyinkɛ cɔr.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Cuarɛ ɣɔw ɛ jiääk ɛmɛ nhɔk kiɛ ŋɔak tin te rɛy ɣɔaa. Nɛy tin nhɔakɛ ni ɣɔw ɛmɛ, /ci nhök Kuɔth in la Gua̱a̱r in te nhial te rɛydiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ti diaal tin te rɛy ɣɔaa kɛ kɛn tin go̱o̱r puɔ̱nykɛ, kɛ ti go̱o̱r waŋ kɛ, kɛ kɛn tin liak naath rɔ̱ kɛ kɛ, bäkɛ kä ɣɔw ɛmɛ, /cikɛ bä kä Gua̱a̱r in te nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣɔw kɛnɛ nyinkɛ bikɛ thuɔ̱k, kä duundɛ ɣöö nɛy tin la̱tkɛ ruac Kuɔth bikɛ tëk amäni cäŋ kɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gua̱n tɛ̈r Kritho",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyin tiɛtnikä, nɛmɛ ɛ jɛn thaak in jɔak! Kä ce̱tkɛ min cia jɛ liŋ ɛn ɣöö gua̱n tɛ̈r Kritho a bëëni, kä täämɛ ci ji̱ tɛ̈r Kritho ti ŋuan ben. Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ ŋäc kɔn ɛ ɛn ɣöö ɛ jɛn thaak in jɔak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cikɛ jiɛɛn rɛydan, kä duundɛ ɣöö /cikɛ te kɛɛl kɛ kɔn. Duŋ mi tekɛ kɛɛl kɛ kɔn, dee kɛ ŋot kɛɛl kɛ kɔn. Kä kɛ wädiɛn raar, cɛ jɔɔc ɛn ɣöö /ci kɛn diaal te kɛɛl kɛ kɔn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ca yɛ mɛk ɛ Kɛl in Gɔaa in Rɛl Rɔ, kä ci yɛn diaal thuɔ̱k ŋa̱c. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Cä gɔ̱r yɛ /ciɛ ɣöö kui̱c yɛn thuɔ̱k, ɛ ɣöö ŋa̱cɛ jɛ, kä ŋa̱cɛ ɣöö thilɛ kac mi bëë raar rɛy thukä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛŋa mi la gua̱n kacä /ciɛ ram mi gaak jɛ ɛn ɣöö Yecu /ciɛ Kritho? Ram ɛmɔ ɛ jɛn gua̱n tɛ̈r Kritho, jɛn ram mi gaak Gua̱a̱r in te nhial kɛnɛ Gatdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thilɛ ram mi gaak Gat mi tëë Gua̱n. Kä ram mi lat ŋäcdɛ kɛ Gat Kuɔth tëëkɛ Gua̱n bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jakɛ mëë ci yɛn ɛ liŋ ni tukä kä cieŋ rɛy lo̱cnikun. Mi wä min cia liŋ ni tukädɛ wä cieŋ rɛy lo̱cnikun bia cieŋ rɛy Gatdä Kuɔth kɛnɛ rɛy Gua̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min cɛ la̱r kɔn, ɛ tëk mi thil pek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän gɔ̱a̱rä yɛ mɛmɛ kɛ kui̱ nɛɛni tin dee yɛ kaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱dun, ɛn mëk in ca mɛk ni yɛ min cieŋ rɛydun, /ci yɛn radɔ̱diɛn go̱r mi dee yɛ ŋi̱eec. Mëkdɛ kɛ yɛ ŋi̱i̱cɛ yɛ kɛ ti diaal, kä ɛ thuɔ̱k, /ciɛ kac. Kä ce̱tkɛ min cɛ yɛ ŋi̱eec, ciëŋɛ rɛydɛ.",
          "type": "text",
